    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI IAO Assignment Process\n\n**Purpose:**\nRecords IAO team assignment changes on a ministry request.\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nSub-workflow called by FOI IAO Process for `foi-iao-open-assignment` and `foi-iao-assignment`.\n\n**Processing:**\nReads the event payload into standard fields, then branches:\n- foi-iao-open-assignment (request in Open state) → audit \"IAO team open-state assignment\"\n- foi-iao-assignment (Call For Records or other states) → audit \"IAO assignment\"\n- other events → end, no action\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nAudit only. Writes a `foi-process-audit` row (process_type = ministry-request-process) with the status, assigned group and assigned person. No API calls.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a046af21-fad7-4813-9fa9-e2d7586a010c",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -272
      ]
    }
